msgid "合成大西八"
msgstr "MergeBigSsibal"

msgid "1–8 人独立落球合成。鼠标瞄准，点击或空格落球；同级圆球相碰合成更大一级并得分。越过红线持续 2 秒结束，落球有入场宽限。默认 3 分钟，全部结束或到时按分数排名。11 级纯色占位，最高级保留在容器中。"
msgstr "1–8 players merge balls in separate bins. Aim with the mouse; click or press Space to drop. Matching tiers merge and score points. Staying above the red line for 2 seconds ends your run, with a grace period for new balls. The default limit is 3 minutes. Rank by score when time runs out or all bins end. Eleven plain-color tiers; the largest stays in the bin."

msgid "比赛时限（秒）"
msgstr "Time limit (seconds)"

